## Get Playlist

```
GET /playlists/:id
```

Returns a playlist by ID with its tracks.

## List My Playlists

```
GET /playlists/me
```

Returns playlists owned by the authenticated user. Requires master authentication.

## Create Playlist

```
POST /playlists
```

Requires master authentication.

### Request Body

```json
{
  "name": "My Playlist",
  "description": "Optional description"
}
```

## Update Playlist

```
PUT /playlists/:id
```

Requires master authentication.

## Delete Playlist

```
DELETE /playlists/:id
```

Requires master authentication.

## Playlist Tracks

```
POST /playlist-tracks       # Add track to playlist
DELETE /playlist-tracks      # Remove track from playlist
```

### Add Track

```json
{
  "playlist_id": "uuid",
  "track_id": "uuid"
}
```
